gh Kalsi\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"An interactive typing speed test with live 1v1 races, weak-key heatmaps, and replays.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://sahiljeet.dev/projects/ciphersprint/cover.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.12d-8c7fbugc9.ico\" sizes=\"32x32\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-16x16.png\" sizes=\"16x16\" type=\"image/png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon-32x32.png\" sizes=\"32x32\" type=\"image/png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon-192.png\" sizes=\"192x192\" type=\"image/png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon-512.png\" sizes=\"512x512\" type=\"image/png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" sizes=\"180x180\" type=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full bg-bg text-text\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>((a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h)=>{let i=document.documentElement,j=[\"light\",\"dark\"];function k(b){var c;(Array.isArray(a)?a:[a]).forEach(a=>{let c=\"class\"===a,d=c&&f?e.map(a=>f[a]||a):e;c?(i.classList.remove(...d),i.classList.add(f&&f[b]?f[b]:b)):i.setAttribute(a,b)}),c=b,h&&j.includes(c)&&(i.style.colorScheme=c)}if(d)k(d);else try{let a=localStorage.getItem(b)||c,d=g&&\"system\"===a?window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\").matches?\"dark\":\"light\":a;k(d)}catch(a){}})(\"data-theme\",\"theme\",\"light\",null,[\"light\",\"dark\"],null,false,true)</script><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pb-24 pt-16 sm:pt-20\"><a class=\"text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/#projects\">← Back to projects</a><article class=\"mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-elevated\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/assets/project-logo1.svg\"/></span><h1 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-text sm:text-3xl\">CipherSprint</h1></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-text\">CipherSprint is a typing test that decodes as you type, in its own amber-on-graphite Cipher theme. It has live 1v1 races with ghost carets, quick match and custom lobbies, a command palette, 51 themes, keystroke-level replays, keyboard heatmaps, friends and DMs, leaderboards, 8 languages, and an installable offline-ready PWA.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://ciphersprint.vercel.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-accent bg-accent px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-90\">Visit live site<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path><path d=\"M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></a><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-bg-elevated px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-text-muted\">React.js</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-bg-elevated px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-text-muted\">Firebase</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-border bg-bg-elevated px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-text-muted\">Framer Motion</span></div></div><div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col gap-8\"><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/01-home-cipher-theme-and-wordmark.png\" alt=\"The typing test in Cipher, CipherSprint&#x27;s own amber-on-graphite theme, with the live caret wordmark.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">The typing test in Cipher, CipherSprint&#x27;s own amber-on-graphite theme, with the live caret wordmark.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/02-decrypt-animation-on-new-test.png\" alt=\"The signature moment: every new test arrives encrypted and decodes into words.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">The signature moment: every new test arrives encrypted and decodes into words.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/03-live-wpm-while-typing.png\" alt=\"Distraction-free typing: the nav fades away and live wpm sits beside the timer.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Distraction-free typing: the nav fades away and live wpm sits beside the timer.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/04-results-new-personal-best.png\" alt=\"Results with a new personal best called out (+17 over the old best), per-second chart and stats.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Results with a new personal best called out (+17 over the old best), per-second chart and stats.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/05-share-card-export.png\" alt=\"One click exports a branded share card of the result.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">One click exports a branded share card of the result.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/06-race-live-lanes-and-ghost-caret.png\" alt=\"Live 1v1 race: a lane per racer and the opponent&#x27;s caret moving through the same text.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Live 1v1 race: a lane per racer and the opponent&#x27;s caret moving through the same text.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/07-race-results-head-to-head.png\" alt=\"Race results side by side, with a two-line speed chart and side-by-side replays.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Race results side by side, with a two-line speed chart and side-by-side replays.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/08-race-lobby-custom-rules.png\" alt=\"Race lobby: the host sets the rules (format, length, punctuation, language) and invites a friend.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Race lobby: the host sets the rules (format, length, punctuation, language) and invites a friend.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/09-quick-match-searching.png\" alt=\"Quick match: get paired with whoever is looking for a race right now.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Quick match: get paired with whoever is looking for a race right now.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/10-race-spectator-view.png\" alt=\"Spectator view: watch both racers&#x27; carets live.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Spectator view: watch both racers&#x27; carets live.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/11-command-palette-theme-preview.png\" alt=\"Ctrl+K command palette: every action from the keyboard, with live theme preview.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Ctrl+K command palette: every action from the keyboard, with live theme preview.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/12-theme-picker-cipher-originals.png\" alt=\"51 themes, with CipherSprint&#x27;s two originals first.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">51 themes, with CipherSprint&#x27;s two originals first.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/13-analytics-keyboard-heatmap.png\" alt=\"Analytics: 10-test moving average, and a keyboard heatmap of the keys you miss.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Analytics: 10-test moving average, and a keyboard heatmap of the keys you miss.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/14-practice-weak-keys.png\" alt=\"&quot;Practise weak keys&quot; builds a test from real words packed with your problem letters.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">&quot;Practise weak keys&quot; builds a test from real words packed with your problem letters.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/15-test-replay-player.png\" alt=\"Replay any test keystroke by keystroke, at 1x, 2x or 4x.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Replay any test keystroke by keystroke, at 1x, 2x or 4x.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/16-profile-race-record.png\" alt=\"Profiles: bests, activity and the race record, including your head-to-head.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Profiles: bests, activity and the race record, including your head-to-head.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/17-friends-and-dm-typing-indicator.png\" alt=\"Friends and DMs in real time, with a blinking caret for &quot;typing&quot;.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Friends and DMs in real time, with a blinking caret for &quot;typing&quot;.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/18-leaderboard-friends-filter.png\" alt=\"Leaderboards for everyone or just your friends, per mode and language.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Leaderboards for everyone or just your friends, per mode and language.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/19-settings-caret-sound-sync.png\" alt=\"Settings: caret style, fonts, synthesised key sounds, all synced to your account.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Settings: caret style, fonts, synthesised key sounds, all synced to your account.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/20-multi-language-spanish-test.png\" alt=\"Eight languages, from Spanish to Hinglish.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Eight languages, from Spanish to Hinglish.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/21-block-and-report-user.png\" alt=\"Safety: report or block anyone, with a review queue for admins.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Safety: report or block anyone, with a review queue for admins.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/22-password-reset.png\" alt=\"Password reset by email, with one-time links that sign out every other device.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Password reset by email, with one-time links that sign out every other device.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/23-offline-mode-pwa.png\" alt=\"Installable and offline-ready: results finished offline sync when you are back.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Installable and offline-ready: results finished offline sync when you are back.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/24-cipher-paper-light-theme.png\" alt=\"Cipher Paper, the light twin of the house theme.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Cipher Paper, the light twin of the house theme.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/25-mobile-typing-test.png\" alt=\"Designed for phones, not shrunk.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted\">Designed for phones, not shrunk.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"/projects/ciphersprint/26-mobile-analytics.png\" alt=\"Analytics on mobile.\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full cursor-zoom-in rounded-xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm\"/><figcaption class=\"mt-2 te